{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/vue/17_라이프사이클/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"라이프사이클-생명주기\" style=\"position:relative;\">라이프사이클 (생명주기)<a href=\"#%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B4%ED%94%84%EC%82%AC%EC%9D%B4%ED%81%B4-%EC%83%9D%EB%AA%85%EC%A3%BC%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"라이프사이클 생명주기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>컴포넌트는 웹페이지에 표시되기까지 일련의 step을 거친다.<br>\n이것을 라이프사이클이라고 한다.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>create 단계</strong> : 데이터만 존재하는 단계</li>\n<li><strong>mount 단계</strong> : 컴포넌트 안의 HTML을 실제 HTML로 바꿔주는 단계</li>\n<li><strong>컴포넌트 생성</strong> : HTML에 장착하는 단계</li>\n<li><strong>update 단계</strong> : data가 변경되어 재렌더링 되는 것</li>\n<li><strong>unmount 단계</strong> : 컴포넌트가 사라짐</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"lifecycle-hook\" style=\"position:relative;\">Lifecycle Hook<a href=\"#lifecycle-hook\" aria-label=\"lifecycle hook permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>이 단계 중간 중간에 Hook을 걸 수 있다.</p>\n<p><strong>예를 들면</strong><br>\n컴포넌트가 mount 되기 전에 이것(Hook)을 실행해주세요.<br>\n컴포넌트가 update되기 전에 이것(Hook)을 실행해주세요.</p>\n<h3 id=\"hook-사용-방법\" style=\"position:relative;\">Hook 사용 방법<a href=\"#hook-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9-%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95\" aria-label=\"hook 사용 방법 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">name</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'App'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token function\">mounted</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"lifecycle-hook-종류\" style=\"position:relative;\">Lifecycle Hook 종류<a href=\"#lifecycle-hook-%EC%A2%85%EB%A5%98\" aria-label=\"lifecycle hook 종류 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class afte